  "reviewNotes": [
    "Six original ARM/occupied/Rosetta reports match the recorded hashes and each has nine passed checks with the original 6c7cb4f source/binary. Four package records agree with the original manifest, independent package audit and checksums; current paths are hardlinks to the audited original packages. No large package/source audit was repeated.",
    "Metadata records actual arm64 and x86_64 slices from the independent original binary audit. Rosetta is explicitly an Apple Silicon mode; Intel native remains unverified, original failed reports and blocked initialization classification remain unchanged. Distribution policy is separate from the original classifier and does not claim the probe establishes game failure causation.",
    "Turbo has no declared save keys, required=false, empty nativeSavedAfterQuit and not_exercised in all three modes. Both human documentation and metadata explicitly describe only empty-state hydration/relaunch, never real save verification.",
    "Kart Royale has actual kr.controls.v1 persisted settings in all three modes, with identical initial storage after native quit/relaunch at a different origin. The original stored data and successful restoration remain the authority.",
    "Turbo instructions obscure approximately 50–60 pixels at the top of the minimap and all three playing stills show 0 km/h; these observed limitations remain in the linked nine-image review and delivery text, without claiming the stills prove driving. Royale Rosetta foreground-wall occlusion is also retained. Native screenshot dimensions 1024x642/645 are distinguished from old browser resolution checks.",
    "All local README and verification links resolve. macOS 11/WebGL2, ad-hoc unsigned-by-Apple/not-notarized, physical controller/full completion untested, and pending Android/Windows states are explicit."
  ],
